# Styling & RTL Rules

- Mobile-first design
- Use Tailwind responsive prefixes correctly
- Prefer logical properties: `ms-`/`me-`, `ps-`/`pe-`, `start`/`end`
- Never hardcode left/right when RTL is possible
- `html` is `lang="he"` `dir="rtl"`
- Use design tokens from `src/app/(frontend)/globals.css` (brand `#f50023`)
- Avoid arbitrary values

## Admin chrome (TailAdmin-inspired)
- Sidebar + sticky top header + gray canvas + white cards
- Keep brand `#f50023` for primary actions and active nav
- Do not copy TailAdmin as a new app — restyle the existing shell in place

Improve existing screens toward these rules. Do not replace working layouts wholesale.
